---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE, CATEGORIES } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description={`How ${SITE.name} works: who writes it, how we test hardware, and how we make money.`}
>
  <div class="wrap page">
    <h1>About {SITE.name}</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        {SITE.name} covers games the way players actually use the internet: you arrive
        with a question, and you leave with the answer. No autoplay, no ten-page
        slideshows, no burying the fix under a thousand words of preamble.
      </p>

      <h2>What we publish</h2>
      <ul>
        {CATEGORIES.map((c) => (
          <li>
            <a href={c.href}><strong>{c.label}</strong></a> — {c.blurb}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>

      <h2>How we test hardware</h2>
      <p>
        Every recommendation in <a href="/setup/">Setup</a> is either hardware we have
        benchmarked ourselves or a part we would put in our own machines based on
        published, reproducible testing. We name the test bench, the settings and the
        resolution. If we have not tested something, we say so.
      </p>

      <h2>How we make money</h2>
      <p>
        Two ways, both disclosed. Display advertising, and affiliate commissions when
        you buy through a link on the site. Commissions never influence a score, a
        ranking or a verdict — the editorial call is made before anyone looks at which
        retailer pays what. Read the full
        <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Corrections</h2>
      <p>
        Games change, patches land, prices move. When we update a guide we stamp it
        with an "Updated" date. If something here is wrong, tell us and we will fix it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    max-width: 820px;
    padding-block: 40px 20px;
  }
  .page h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent);
    padding-bottom: 14px;
  }
</style>
